- Videoplayer changed to WebM Player - it has to fix the problem with flickering. Also it has to fix problems with recording and streaming while playing the cutscenes;
- Added a slider for adjusting audio level for cutscenes;
- Added an English localization for pages from Urosh’s diary;
- Minor edits on the Cemetery and Road to the Cemetery backgrounds;
- Minor edits on Femi’s and Slough Roui’s sprites.

[list]
[*] fixed cutscenes after the dialogue with the Veglamb; 
[*] fixed crash on apology dialogue with Alek;
[*] minor fixes in the 2nd Chapter scenes; 
[*] fixed Lazy's mouth sprites in the evening forest altdialogue;
[*] fixed condition of getting the achievement for choosing an ax/shovel;
[*] fixed minor bugs and typos.
[/list]

[list]
[*] Fixed softlock on Juny; 
[*] Fixed bug with appearing lines from 2nd Chapter inside the Abandoned House in the 2st Chapter;
[*] Fixed an apologies dialogue with Alek in an Axe route; 
