We're listening carefully to all your bug reports and fixing everything (:

[list]
[*] ► Fixed racoot's animation at the Goblin cafe;
[*] ► Fixed typos in Russian and English;
[*] ► Fixed the missing description of the plush Glashtin and wooden Karkadann in English;
[*] ► Fixed bug with an achievement "Friends Forever"
[*] ► Added a list of licenses to the credits.
[/list]

After you download the update, please, verify your game files.
[url=https://support.steampowered.com/kb/2037-QEUH-3335/verify-integrity-of-game-cache?l=english][b]The instruction how to do it.[/b][/url]

Hello again, guys! How are you doing?
We have prepared the first hotfix for you that we managed to finish today!

[b] Detailed list: [/b]
[list]
[*] Fixed crash bugs in the shovel route;
[*] [i]Alek's Boatshed[/i] location is working properly now;
[*] Quest with the letter could be successfully complete, whether the letter's envelope is opened or sealed when you give it to Vander;
[*] Fixed hotspots;
[*] Fixed bugs with Tigla-Dera's day/evening rendering;
[*] Fixed bugs with Flynn's sprite;
[*] Added English lines that were missing;
[*] Other minor bugs were fixed;
[/list]

After a long and hard work on the game and the beta-testing, which was exhausting for both testers and the team, we are ready to inform you that the remaster is finally finished! Last time we mentioned why the remaster is necessary, but we will repeat it again: during the work on Chapter One we leveled up, and the initial code could interfere greatly with our work on the game in the future.
In any case, what has been done - is done! Here is a list (and it's even incomplete) of what we reworked and added into the Crown:

[list]
[*] ► Changed the resolution of the game from 1280×720 to 1920×1080 (Full HD);
[*] ► Redrew the backgrounds: the Greenhouse, Goblin Cafe;
[*] ► Redrew Brilla and Emeral sprites;
[*] ► Redid the Inventory;
[*] ► Added the Journal;
[*] ► Rewrote some articles in the Mindscape, wrote new ones;
[*] ► Added an illustration to each article;
[*] ► Improved the quality of translation into English and got rid of missed mistakes;
[*] ► Changed the system of interactions with characters, made it more convenient;
[/list]
and much more!

We also decided to please you with additional content that will slightly open the veil of secrecy over the story of Roui's family, and tell you a little more about the world of Shang-La. This DLC is free, and it's already included in the game - you don't need to download anything. But how to find it - we won't tell you  Pick up the shovel and go look for it boldly. It will be difficult, but we believe in you!

DLC will add to the game:
[list]
[*] ► Two new characters;
[*] ► Two new music tracks from [url=https://vk.com/theartofcomposing]_Blacksmith_[/url];
[*] ► Two new backgrounds;
[*] ► Three new Steam achievements
[/list]

Alas, we also have some bad news. Since [u][b]we had to redo the entire structure of the game, the old saves will not work anymore - please, delete them![/b][/u]. We are really very ashamed that it happened, but we didn't have a choice. However, do not be discouraged! We added the possibility to skip the text, so it will be easy to make up for lost time (and hunt for achievements, of course ;)).

Finally, the answer to the question: "When is the Second Chapter coming out?".
The answer is: we don't know. All this time we were also actively working on it and we did not forget about it for a minute. Despite the setbacks and serious problems that haunted us throughout the year, we did not give up and we are still focused on the Crown. But naming the specific dates isn't our way. Yes, we are slow. But we are working on as much details as possible, we are paying attention to all the choices you made in the first chapter, even the minor ones. Moreover, in the new chapter, the script will also be divided into several routes.
In any case, judging by the amount of the content that we already have, we can say that the second chapter will be way longer than the first one.

